{
  "abstract": "<p>In this <i>GEN</i> webinar, downstream process development and scale up manufacturing specialists will discuss practical strategies for building robust purification processes when the target molecule misbehaves.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.genengnews.com/multimedia/webinars/downstream-processing-purifying-complex-antibody-therapeutics-when-target-molecules-misbehave/\">Downstream Processing: Purifying Complex Antibody Therapeutics When Target Molecules Misbehave</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.genengnews.com\">GEN - Genetic Engineering and Biotechnology News</a>.</p>",
