        "value": "<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><button class=\"wp-block-malblocks-scroll-button scroll-button theme-bg\">Register Now</button></p>\n\n<h3 class=\"w-full text-left\">\n    <strong>\n         Panelists    </strong>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"flex flex-row m-0-auto items-stretch justify-center flex-wrap mb-4\">\n    \n<div class=\"border-none min-h-48 w-full md:w-1/2 grow lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4  xl:max-w-1/4 md:max-w-1/2 lg:max-w-1/3\" id=\"presenter-card-0\">\n    <div class=\"items-center w-full flex flex-col gap-2 align-center\">\n        <div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col bg-white rounded-md text-center\" id=\"presenter-content-0\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center grow gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"!max-w-[150px] !mb-6 !overflow-hidden rounded-full aspect-square\">\n                    <img alt=\"Image of David Scherr, PhD\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scherr-headshot-e1794584066338.png\" />\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"!text-[16px] !leading-[24px] !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 mb-0\">David Scherr, PhD</h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mt-0 !text-[15px] !leading-[21px]\" style=\"color: #444444;\">Sr. Scientist<br />Bioprocess Technologies &#038; Engineering<br />Biopharmaceutical Development<br />AstraZeneca</h3>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"!w-auto hover:!bg-gray-100 !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center !mt-1 !text-xl shadow-none !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none border-1 !bg-white text-center !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:!border-borderDark font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                View Bio\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<dialog class=\"dui-modal\" id=\"presenter_modal_0\">\n    <div class=\"dui-modal-box bg-white p-0 rounded-none min-w-1/2 w-full max-w-full  sm:max-w-5/6 lg:max-w-[1040px]\">\n        <div class=\"!pl-5 !pr-3 flex flex-row space-between w-full items-center !py-2\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-normal w-full !text-gray-600 !font-roboto mb-0 py-2 !text-[20px]\">Panelist</h3>\n            <button class=\"dui-btn !highlight-none hover:!bg-white shadow-none !bg-white border-none\">\n                <img alt=\"Close Button\" class=\"text-gray-200 mb-0\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/genengnews-nonnewspaper/assets/svg/icons8-close-18.svg\" />\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        <div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr_1fr_1fr] mx-[7%] my-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row w-full justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-span-1 !overflow-hidden !max-w-[150px]\">\n                        <img alt=\"Image of David Scherr, PhD\" class=\"object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scherr-headshot-e1794584066338.png\" />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col col-span-3 sm:!ml-12 biomodal\">\n                    <h2 class=\"!text-[20px] !mb-4 !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 !text-center sm:!text-left\">David Scherr, PhD</h2>\n                    <p class=\"!text-[15px] !leading-[24px] text-justify\" style=\"color: #444444;\"><p>David Scherr, PhD, is a senior scientist at AstraZeneca focusing on downstream process development for the Integrated Dynamic Bioprocessing (IDB) platform. He joined AstraZeneca in 2023 and has been a part of CMC teams for GMP implementation of continuous antibody purification. David has also led efforts to implement high-throughput process development and AI-first ways of working. David earned his BS in biochemistry and chemistry from the University of Miami followed by a PhD in biological systems engineering at Virginia Tech.</p>\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"dui-modal-action\">\n                    <form class=\"bg-white\" method=\"dialog\">\n                        <!-- if there is a button in form, it will close the modal -->\n                        <button class=\"!w-auto shadow-none bottom-12 right-12 sm:static !text-xl !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none !bg-white border-1 text-center hover:!bg-gray-100 !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:border-borderDark !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center mt-1 text-6 font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                            Close\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</dialog>\n<div class=\"border-none min-h-48 w-full md:w-1/2 grow lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4  xl:max-w-1/4 md:max-w-1/2 lg:max-w-1/3\" id=\"presenter-card-1\">\n    <div class=\"items-center w-full flex flex-col gap-2 align-center\">\n        <div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col bg-white rounded-md text-center\" id=\"presenter-content-1\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center grow gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"!max-w-[150px] !mb-6 !overflow-hidden rounded-full aspect-square\">\n                    <img alt=\"Image of Anupama Kante, PhD\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kante-headshot-e1794584145723.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"!text-[16px] !leading-[24px] !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 mb-0\">Anupama Kante, PhD</h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mt-0 !text-[15px] !leading-[21px]\" style=\"color: #444444;\">Scientist<br />Avid Bioservices</h3>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"!w-auto hover:!bg-gray-100 !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center !mt-1 !text-xl shadow-none !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none border-1 !bg-white text-center !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:!border-borderDark font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                View Bio\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<dialog class=\"dui-modal\" id=\"presenter_modal_1\">\n    <div class=\"dui-modal-box bg-white p-0 rounded-none min-w-1/2 w-full max-w-full  sm:max-w-5/6 lg:max-w-[1040px]\">\n        <div class=\"!pl-5 !pr-3 flex flex-row space-between w-full items-center !py-2\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-normal w-full !text-gray-600 !font-roboto mb-0 py-2 !text-[20px]\">Panelist</h3>\n            <button class=\"dui-btn !highlight-none hover:!bg-white shadow-none !bg-white border-none\">\n                <img alt=\"Close Button\" class=\"text-gray-200 mb-0\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/genengnews-nonnewspaper/assets/svg/icons8-close-18.svg\" />\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        <div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr_1fr_1fr] mx-[7%] my-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row w-full justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-span-1 !overflow-hidden !max-w-[150px]\">\n                        <img alt=\"Image of Anupama Kante, PhD\" class=\"object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kante-headshot-e1794584145723.jpg\" />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col col-span-3 sm:!ml-12 biomodal\">\n                    <h2 class=\"!text-[20px] !mb-4 !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 !text-center sm:!text-left\">Anupama Kante, PhD</h2>\n                    <p class=\"!text-[15px] !leading-[24px] text-justify\" style=\"color: #444444;\"><p>Anupama Kante, PhD, is a scientist in downstream process development at Avid Bioservices specializing in biologics purification, formulation development, and analytical characterization. She has extensive experience advancing monoclonal antibodies and complex biologics from early development through process optimization. Anupama is passionate about building scientific capabilities, driving innovation, and translating technical insights into practical solutions.</p>\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"dui-modal-action\">\n                    <form class=\"bg-white\" method=\"dialog\">\n                        <!-- if there is a button in form, it will close the modal -->\n                        <button class=\"!w-auto shadow-none bottom-12 right-12 sm:static !text-xl !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none !bg-white border-1 text-center hover:!bg-gray-100 !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:border-borderDark !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center mt-1 text-6 font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                            Close\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</dialog>\n<div class=\"border-none min-h-48 w-full md:w-1/2 grow lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4  xl:max-w-1/4 md:max-w-1/2 lg:max-w-1/3\" id=\"presenter-card-2\">\n    <div class=\"items-center w-full flex flex-col gap-2 align-center\">\n        <div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col bg-white rounded-md text-center\" id=\"presenter-content-2\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center grow gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"!max-w-[150px] !mb-6 !overflow-hidden rounded-full aspect-square\">\n                    <img alt=\"Image of Sam Ruesing, PhD\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ruesing-headshot-e1794584239214.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"!text-[16px] !leading-[24px] !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 mb-0\">Sam Ruesing, PhD</h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mt-0 !text-[15px] !leading-[21px]\" style=\"color: #444444;\">Sr. Staff Scientist<br />Thermo Fisher Scientific</h3>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"!w-auto hover:!bg-gray-100 !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center !mt-1 !text-xl shadow-none !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none border-1 !bg-white text-center !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:!border-borderDark font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                View Bio\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<dialog class=\"dui-modal\" id=\"presenter_modal_2\">\n    <div class=\"dui-modal-box bg-white p-0 rounded-none min-w-1/2 w-full max-w-full  sm:max-w-5/6 lg:max-w-[1040px]\">\n        <div class=\"!pl-5 !pr-3 flex flex-row space-between w-full items-center !py-2\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-normal w-full !text-gray-600 !font-roboto mb-0 py-2 !text-[20px]\">Panelist</h3>\n            <button class=\"dui-btn !highlight-none hover:!bg-white shadow-none !bg-white border-none\">\n                <img alt=\"Close Button\" class=\"text-gray-200 mb-0\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/genengnews-nonnewspaper/assets/svg/icons8-close-18.svg\" />\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        <div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr_1fr_1fr] mx-[7%] my-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row w-full justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-span-1 !overflow-hidden !max-w-[150px]\">\n                        <img alt=\"Image of Sam Ruesing, PhD\" class=\"object-cover\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ruesing-headshot-e1794584239214.jpg\" />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col col-span-3 sm:!ml-12 biomodal\">\n                    <h2 class=\"!text-[20px] !mb-4 !font-palatino !font-bold mt-0 !text-center sm:!text-left\">Sam Ruesing, PhD</h2>\n                    <p class=\"!text-[15px] !leading-[24px] text-justify\" style=\"color: #444444;\"><p>Sam Ruesing, PhD, is a senior staff scientist in downstream process development at Thermo Fisher Scientific. He holds a bachelor’s degree in chemical engineering from the Missouri University of Science and Technology and PhD in biomedical engineering from Saint Louis University. Sam’s experience spans all aspects of downstream development, including early-phase development for first-in-human production, adapting processes to new facilities, and late-phase optimization and characterization in preparation for commercialization.</p>\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"dui-modal-action\">\n                    <form class=\"bg-white\" method=\"dialog\">\n                        <!-- if there is a button in form, it will close the modal -->\n                        <button class=\"!w-auto shadow-none bottom-12 right-12 sm:static !text-xl !text-gen-red dui-btn rounded-none !bg-white border-1 text-center hover:!bg-gray-100 !border-gen-red hover:!border-borderDark focus:border-borderDark !py-[16px] !px-[18px] self-center mt-1 text-6 font-roboto! font-bold\" type=\"button\">\n                            Close\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 h-[1px]\"></div>        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</dialog></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height: 34px;\"></div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-malblocks-webinars-info\"><div><strong>Broadcast Date:</strong> <time>Tuesday, December 8, 2026</time><br /><ul style=\"padding-left: 0;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0;\"><strong>Time:</strong> <time datetime=\"2026-12-08T16:00:00.000Z\">08:00 PST, 11:00 EST, 16:00 GMT</time></li></ul></div></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height: 43px;\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As antibody-based therapeutics move beyond IgG monoclonal antibodies, downstream process development teams have to purify molecules that do not always fit established platform assumptions. Bispecifics, multispecifics, antibody fragments, Fc-fusion proteins, ADCs, and other engineered formats can introduce new challenges in assembly, stability, impurity profiles, and scalability. Separation of the target molecule from mispaired chains, homodimers, aggregates, fragments, free light chains, persistent host cell proteins, and format-specific product variants can fall outside the limits of standard Protein A, AEX, and CEX purification workflows. For many PD teams, the platform process remains the proper starting point, but the molecule does not always behave like the platform expects.</p>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this <em>GEN</em> webinar, downstream process development and scale up manufacturing specialists will discuss practical strategies for building robust purification processes when the target molecule misbehaves. The discussion will explore how teams decide whether to stay with a platform, adapt it, or move to a more molecule-specific toolbox, how alternative affinity approaches can help when Protein A lacks selectivity or is not applicable, and how polishing strategies with IEX, HIC, and mixed-mode chromatography can be used to address difficult product- and process-related impurities. The panel will also discuss how to balance speed, yield, purity, cost of goods, analytical burden, scalability, and regulatory expectations from early development through tech transfer and manufacturing of standard mAbs and beyond.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height: 40px;\"></div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>A live Q&amp;A session will follow the presentation offering you a chance to pose questions to our expert panelists.</em></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height: 30px;\"></div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Produced with support from:</strong></p>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignleft size-medium\"><a href=\"https://www.thermofisher.com/\" rel=\" noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Thermo Fisher logo\" class=\"wp-image-221790\" height=\"138\" src=\"https://www.genengnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/ThermoFisher_logo-300x138.png\" width=\"300\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.genengnews.com/multimedia/webinars/downstream-processing-purifying-complex-antibody-therapeutics-when-target-molecules-misbehave/\">Downstream Processing: Purifying Complex Antibody Therapeutics When Target Molecules Misbehave</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.genengnews.com\">GEN - Genetic Engineering and Biotechnology News</a>.</p>"
      }
